0..64 Comment "/// This source derives function extensionality from univalence."
65..68 Comment "///"
69..125 Comment "/// The diagonal makes each point into a reflexive path."
126..174 Comment "/// A homotopy gives a map into that path space."
175..178 Comment "///"
179..248 Comment "/// The checker turns the diagonal equivalence into a path with `ua`."
249..315 Comment "/// Transport then proves that the path-space endpoints are equal."
316..319 Comment "///"
320..369 Comment "/// - see: corpus/model/identity/univalence.gandr"
